-- A definition that three-hop-rules.l4 imports. It calls one that
-- residency.l4 defines, which this file reaches only through the file it
-- imports, franchise.l4. A file of the agreement corpus with no
-- "agreement:" line is read only by the files that import it.

IMPORT franchise

GIVEN person IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the person may cast a ballot` person MEANS `the person is resident` person
